{"id": "working-solutions-development-grant-timekeeping", "title": "Auditors questioned $400,000 charged without a record of how staff divided their time", "seconds": 42.0, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "2aa9045c9b31c2ca", "words": 119, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors examined a federal award to a San Francisco community lender.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.99, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "community", "lender’s", "grant"], "sub": "A federal award with different uses"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Treasury records a $1 million award.", "t0": 4.11, "t1": 6.52, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1 million", "label": "A federal award with different uses"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The spending schedule separates development services from the loan loss reserve.", "t0": 6.64, "t1": 10.53, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "schedule", "layout": "table", "heading": "Federal expenditure schedule", "context": "Development grant", "rows": [{"label": "Development services", "value": "$400,000"}, {"label": "Loan loss reserve", "value": "$100,000"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors questioned $400,000 for development services.", "t0": 10.75, "t1": 14.39, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$400,000", "label": "Time charged from a budget"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The budget did not document how employees divided their time.", "t0": 14.51, "t1": 17.49, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Employee time"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Two findings point to the same timekeeping problem.", "t0": 17.61, "t1": 19.91, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "audit", "layout": "table", "heading": "One timekeeping issue", "context": "Development grant", "rows": [{"label": "Financial statement", "value": "2016-001"}, {"label": "Federal award", "value": "2016-002"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The second reference does not double the $400,000.", "t0": 20.03, "t1": 23.36, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Two references, one control issue", "text": "Questioned costs", "mark": "Questioned"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2017 the lender reported adding a compliance director role.", "t0": 23.58, "t1": 27.19, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "later", "kicker": "A timesheet system and a later status", "text": "Compliance director", "mark": "Compliance"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It also introduced a timesheet tool.", "t0": 27.31, "t1": 29.32, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "later", "kicker": "A timesheet system and a later status", "text": "Timesheet tool", "mark": "Timesheet"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The following audit recorded the correction.", "t0": 29.44, "t1": 31.41, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "later", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2017 follow-up", "context": "Development grant", "rows": [{"label": "Timekeeping", "value": "Corrected"}, {"label": "Final cost decision", "value": "Outstanding"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditors issued an unmodified opinion on major program compliance.", "t0": 31.63, "t1": 35.47, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Two references, one control issue", "text": "Major program opinion", "mark": "Major"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Treasury’s final decision would show whether it recovered any money.", "t0": 35.69, "t1": 38.77, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final cost decision"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.89, "t1": 41.11, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A federal award with different uses", "b": "Time charged from a budget", "o": "A timesheet system and a later status"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document", "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca"}
